    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "BARRY AUCTIONEERS & VALUERS are thrilled to bring this excellent opportunity to acquire a well-proportioned three-bedroom semi-detached home in a highly sought-after location.\r\n\r\nThe property offers generous living accommodation with excellent potential to create a comfortable and contemporary family home. While the house would benefit from cosmetic upgrading and modernisation, it provides a superb blank canvas for a new owner to put their own stamp on the property.\r\n\r\nA particular feature is the south-facing rear garden with apple tree, which enjoys excellent natural light and offers significant potential for outdoor entertaining, gardening or creating a private family space.\r\n\r\nAccommodation comprises three bedrooms, spacious living areas and the usual kitchen and bathroom facilities, with the layout offering scope for future enhancement subject to the necessary planning requirements.\r\n\r\nPic Du Jer is a mature and established residential development, conveniently located close to Ballinlough, with easy access to Cork city centre and a wide range of local amenities, schools, shops, sports facilities and transport links.\r\n\r\nNo. 37 Pic Du Jer is an ideal opportunity for first-time buyers, families or investors looking for a property with strong potential in a convenient Cork location. Early viewing is recommended to appreciate the possibilities this home has to offer."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance hall: - \r\n Understairs storage\n\r\n\r\nLiving room: - 4.09m x 3.9m \r\n To the front of the property. Bay window, Fireplace, Laminated flooring.\r\n\r\nDining room; - 4.02m x 2.8m \r\nTo the rear of the property. Laminated flooring, fire place, leading to the Sunroom.\n\r\n\r\nSunroom; - 4.04m x 4.02m \r\n Tiled floor, rear door leading to rear garden.\r\n\r\nKitchen /Dining: - 5.8m x 3.8m \r\n Fitted kitchen, electric cooker and hob, washing machine, dryer, fridge freezer.\r\n\r\nDownstairs WC - \r\n And separate shower room.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1: - 3.94m x 4.17m \r\nTo rear of property, Timber floor, fireplace.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: - 3.6m x 3.18m \r\nTo front of property, laminated flooring, built in presses.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3: - 2.25m x 2.11m \r\nTo front of property, laminated flooring.\n\r\n\r\nFamily bathroom; - \r\nExtensively tiled, electric walk in shower.\n\r\n\r\nLanding window. - \r\n\r\n\r\nGarage - 4.76m x 2.8m \r\nTo the side of the property.\n\r\n\r\n"
      },
